{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>Unto the wilderness of Paran, Kadesh.</b> The wilderness of Paran and the wilderness of Zin and Hazeroth and Kadesh-barnea and Rithmah are adjacent to one another, for it is written here: ״the people journeyed from Hazeroth and encamped in the wilderness of Paran.״ And that is Rithmah, as explained in the section of Journeys, and there it is written: ״and they encamped in the wilderness of Zin, which is Kadesh,״ and here it is written: ״unto the wilderness of Paran, Kadesh,״ and in the section of Mattot it is written: ״send them from Kadesh-barnea.״"], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:51.539080929Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}